nCladue: Here is the recent sales data: [Claude provides a concise summary of the sales data, key metrics, and any important trends. No long explanations or code blocks, just the essential information.]\\n\\nUser: what are recent clicnical trials on breast cancer? [Sent from mobile session]\\nCladue: [look up recent clinical trials] -> [show the title for the first 1 or 2 most relevant ones] -> [offer options to get more details if needed]\\n</mobile_session>\"}},\"3577306740\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3581778638\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3581979392\":{\"defaultValue\":{}},\"3582597095\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3582760478\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3584486043\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3585501268\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3585733365\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3587512858\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3588988143\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3591394191\":{\"defaultValue\":{\"model\":\"global\"}},\"3595719423\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3597425858\":{\"defaultValue\":{\"ccr_enabled\":false,\"cowork_enabled\":false}},\"3600267698\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3601156465\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3601401216\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3601981513\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3614657944\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3615229285\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3616364978\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3619252400\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3622295435\":{\"defaultValue\":\"dd2a3340-0654-40d2-a57a-43444e1ecd1c\"},\"3623650552\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3625217186\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3625719812\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3626487700\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3627505652\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3628609460\":{\"defaultValue\":{\"features\":{\"enabled_turmeric\":{\"description\":\"Create apps, prototypes, and interactive documents that use Claude inside the artifact. Start by saying, “Let’s build an AI app...” to access the power of Claude API.\",\"image\":{\"height\":320,\"src\":\"/images/feature-preview/harmony.png\",\"width\":640},\"title\":\"Create AI-powered artifacts\"},\"preview_feature_uses_artifacts\":{\"description\":\"Ask Claude to generate content like code snippets, text documents, or website designs, and Claude will create an Artifact that appears in a dedicated window alongside your conversation.\",\"image\":{\"height\":356,\"src\":\"/images/feature-preview/artifacts.png\",\"width\":678},\"shortDescription\":\"Create and iterate on documents, code, and more within Claude.\",\"title\":\"Artifacts\"},\"preview_feature_uses_latex\":{\"description\":\"LaTeX allows Claude to render mathematical equations in a consistent manner. Applies to new conversations only.\",\"image\":{\"height\":142,\"src\":\"/images/feature-preview/latex.png\",\"width\":453},\"title\":\"LaTeX rendering\"}}}},\"3628777876\":{\"defaultValue\":{\"max_version\":\"1.40609.0\",\"message_variant\":\"required\",\"model_display_name\":\"Claude Fable 5.1\",\"model_id\":\"claude-fable-5-1\"}},\"3631316609\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3631683338\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3631735271\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3632895695\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3634436734\":{\"defaultValue\":\"\"},\"3635490728\":{\"defaultValue\":true},\"3636365693\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3636606509\":{\"defaultValue\":false},\"3636744757\":{\"defaultValue\":{\"max_local_sessions\":6}},\"3639202772\":{\"defaultValue\":{\"approval_card\":true,\"prompt_addendum\":\"You're helping an organization admin manage Claude.ai settings. Lead with what you can do via tools — offer to act before giving generic advice. Don't address the user by their organization name.\\n\\nFor pages your tools don't cover, link directly: billing & invoices at /admin-settings/billing, usage analytics at /admin-settings/analytics, SSO/SCIM at /admin-settings/identity.\\n\\nFor how-to questions, if web search is available, search site:support.claude.com. Don't search for current setting values — read those via get_organization_settings. Support URL is support.claude.com (not support.anthropic.com).\"}}