lwg9w\":\"No members match your search.\",\"secret:1a1me54\":\"Couldn't load members. Try again.\",\"secret:ycsct9\":\"Showing the first {count} members. Search to find anyone missing.\",\"secret:1v63l1r\":\"Skipped {count, plural, one {1 member} other {# members}}: recently invited, no longer eligible, or couldn't be emailed.\",\"secret:nh7cf2\":\"Not all members could be checked. Try again later to reach those who were missed.\",\"secret:5rvnyy\":\"Couldn't send invites. Try again.\",\"secret:hfg9l\":\"Showing the first {count} members.\",\"secret:yejxnj\":\"This list may be incomplete — try again in a moment.\",\"secret:1bzogie\":\"Claude Code and Cowork credit\",\"secret:vbr3xg\":\"A one-time credit for Claude Code and Cowork, applied before your usage limits. After it's used up, both features draw from your normal usage.\",\"secret:y7zo4g\":\"Included credit\",\"secret:13s3ih1\":\"Only the first {loadedCount, number} of {eligibleCountDisplay} eligible members are shown here.\",\"secret:jr11t5\":\"Select all {eligibleCountDisplay} eligible members\",\"secret:j02wql\":\"{eligibleCountDisplay} eligible members in your organization are selected.\",\"secret:1i42zkl\":\"{eligibleCountDisplay} eligible members in your organization are selected, except {excludedCount, plural, one {1 member} other {# members}} you've unchecked.\",\"secret:1yyblym\":\"Clear the selection and switch to manual selection\",\"secret:jlr1jt\":\"Include everyone\",\"secret:16isyz9\":\"Switch to manual selection\",\"secret:1i20uye\":\"Email {recipientCountDisplay} eligible members?\",\"secret:6bfm9w\":\"Every eligible member in your organization will receive the activation credit email.\",\"secret:j0rfh8\":\"Every eligible member in your organization will receive the activation credit email, except the {excludedCount, plural, one {1 member} other {# members}} you unchecked.\",\"secret:1a13566\":\"Email {recipientCountDisplay} members\",\"secret:1x0un8n\":\"We'll send an email and a nudge inviting them to try Claude Code and Cowork.\",\"secret:1b52eud\":\"Email and nudge {recipientCountDisplay} eligible members?\",\"secret:1aymm1j\":\"Every eligible member in your organization will receive the activation credit email and an in-product nudge.\",\"secret:19zm54v\":\"Every eligible member in your organization will receive the activation credit email and an in-product nudge, except the {excludedCount, plural, one {1 member} other {# members}} you unchecked.\",\"secret:y53625\":\"Email and nudge {recipientCountDisplay} members\",\"secret:n943i2\":\"Emailed and nudged {count, plural, one {1 member} other {# members}}\",\"secret:7lj2bj\":\"A bulk send is in progress. It usually finishes within a few minutes.\",\"secret:oqrigw\":\"{scannedCount, number} of {totalCount, number} members have been processed so far. Invites already sent will still be delivered — stopping only prevents the remaining sends.\",\"secret:ok9eb5\":\"Sending stopped. {queuedCount, plural, one {1 invite was} other {# invites were}} already queued.\",\"secret:18wvxej\":\"The last bulk send didn't finish. Sending again will skip members who were invited in the last hour.\",\"secret:zddham\":\"Bulk sending isn't available right now. You can still select and invite members individually.\",\"secret:479uty\":\"Couldn't start the bulk send. Try again.\",\"secret:1valcp0\":\"Too many members are unchecked to use select all. Re-check some members, or invite members individually.\",\"secret:wwfm24\":\"Skipped {count, plural, one {1 member} other {# members}}: recently invited, no longer eligible, or couldn't be reached.\",\"secret:1e8q4nw\":\"A bulk email send is in progress. It usually finishes within a few minutes.\",\"secret:1gf8x51\":\"Stop sending\",\"secret:1hatr3\":\"Stop this bulk send?\",\"secret:rj94aj\":\"{scannedCount, number} of {totalCount, number} members have been processed so far. Emails already sent will still be delivered — stopping only prevents the remaining sends.\",\"secret:1lx8iub\":\"Keep sending\",\"secret:1sgo016\":\"Sending stopped. {queuedCount, plural, one {1 email was} other {# emails were}} already queued.\",\"secret:gir5e6\":\"Couldn't stop the send. Try again.\",\"secret:em6txi\":\"Bulk send status is temporarily unavailable.\",\"secret:bo4pxc\":\"The last bulk email send didn't finish. Sending again will skip members who were emailed in the last hour.\",\"secret:tbn4ml\":\"Bulk sending isn't available right now. You can still select and email members individually.\",\"secret:1q8gzvp\":\"Couldn't start the bulk email send. Try again.\",\"secret:snk7jr\":\"Too many members are unchecked to use select all. Re-check some members, or email members individually.\",\"secret:3yr8xx\":\"Export CSV\",\"secret:1olvqnr\":\"Couldn't export members. You can try again.\",\"secret:10w8ll3\":\"The exported file may be incomplete. Export again to retry.\",\"secret:1m6a9my\":\"Invite from your admin\",\"secret:1j2pdh\":\"Your admin wants you to try Cowork\",\"secret:64ws4l\":\"Your admin wants you to try Claude Code\",\"secret:zltfxp\":\"Switch to Cowork or Claude Code for complex work and repeatable tasks.\",\"secret:1g0vrop\":\"Run multiple complex tasks in the background while you focus on other work.\",\"secret:zlu2jd\":\"Build, debug, and ship just by describing what you need.\",\"secret:m65quy\":\"Try Cowork or Claude Code\",\"secret:m66dgm\":\"Try Claude Code\",\"secret:1wntcs6\":\"Try Cowork\",\"secret:1jc0tux\":\"For more complex work and repeatable tasks.\",\"secret:12hf6kb\":\"Inference hooks\",\"secret:15id3rg\":\"Allow for your organization\",\"secret:svsprd\":\"Route prompts to your endpoint for inspection before Claude processes them.\",\"secret:t7b28i\":\"Couldn't load the inference hooks configuration. Reload the page to try again.\",\"secret:7l77pe\":\"{url} · Enforcement off\",\"secret:ovs4bh\":\"No endpoint configured yet\",\"secret:5wot0j\":\"Configure\",\"secret:6n4a2i\":\"Set up\",\"secret:1avnzss\":\"Configure inference hooks\",\"secret:190ih4e\":\"Set up inference hooks\",\"secret:xtksvy\":\"Send prompts to your endpoint for inspection before Claude processes them.\",\"secret:1d64vtw\":\"Inference hooks settings saved\",\"secret:1egt2ll\":\"Couldn't save inference hooks settings.\",\"secret:1b386sq\":\"Inference hooks are turned off\",\"secret:qpqbm8\":\"Turn them on in Data and privacy settings to configure your endpoint.\",\"secret:7qhiua\":\"Go to Data and privacy\",\"secret:1gnfmbh\":\"Get started\",\"secret:9fg8yr\":\"Point Claude at your endpoint: an https:// URL, plus any headers it needs to authenticate requests.\",\"secret:9fg8ys\":\"Test the connection. Claude sends a synthetic prompt to your endpoint and shows you the verdict before anything is enforced.\",\"secret:9fg8yt\":\"Save. Your webhook signing secret is generated and shown once. Turn on enforcement when you are ready.\",\"secret:fwltck\":\"Enforce verdicts\",\"secret:1ac2y7l\":\"Gate Claude on your endpoint's verdict for every prompt. Turning this off stops inspection entirely. Takes effect immediately.\",\"secret:xso464\":\"Enforcement is off. Prompts from your organization aren't being inspected.\",\"secret:1r65fdk\":\"Turn on enforcement?\",\"secret:1t7p01z\":\"Every prompt from your organization will be gated on your endpoint's verdict. If the endpoint cannot be reached, prompts will be allowed through without inspection. Change that under Failure handling.\",\"secret:fehze1\":\"Every prompt from your organization will be gated on your endpoint's verdict. If the endpoint cannot be reached, requests will be blocked. Change that under Failure handling.\",\"secret:tb8vk9\":\"About {pct}% of prompts from your organization will be gated on your endpoint's verdict, following your rollout setting; the rest won't be inspected. If the endpoint cannot be reached, those prompts will be allowed through without inspection. Change that under Failure handling.\",\"secret:1rqojhn\":\"About {pct}% of prompts from your organization will be gated on your endpoint's verdict, following your rollout setting; the rest won't be inspected. If the endpoint cannot be reached, those prompts will be blocked. Change that under Failure handling.\",\"secret:mwrin1\":\"Prompts from your organization will be sent to your endpoint in shadow mode: verdicts are recorded, but nothing is blocked until you turn shadow mode off.\",\"secret:1cxr4v3\":\"About {pct}% of prompts from your organization will be sent to your endpoint in shadow mode, following your rollout setting; the rest won't be inspected. Verdicts are recorded, but nothing is blocked until you turn shadow mode off.\",\"secret:ckzrj2\":\"Turn on\",\"secret:18wjvxk\":\"Turn off enforcement?\",\"secret:jrqb2q\":\"Prompts from your organization will no longer be inspected until you turn enforcement back on.\",\"secret:yx8ff4\":\"Turn off\",\"secret:1r68vdz\":\"Enforcement is on\",\"secret:18wnbxz\":\"Enforcement is off\",\"secret:i3bhty\":\"Shadow mode\",\"secret:15n75v8\":\"Turn on shadow mode?\",\"secret:1i19a12\":\"While enforcement is on, prompts keep flowing to your endpoint and its verdicts are recorded, but nothing is blocked — even when your endpoint denies a prompt or can't be reached. Verdicts are enforced again when you turn shadow mode off.\",\"secret:gv26x8\":\"Turn off shadow mode?\",\"secret:1x9w3ji\":\"While enforcement is on, your endpoint's verdicts will be enforced again: denied prompts are blocked, and an unreachable endpoint follows your Failure handling setting.\",\"secret:15nalvn\":\"Shadow mode is on — while enforcement is on, verdicts are recorded but nothing is blocked\",\"secret:gv5mxn\":\"Shadow mode is off — while enforcement is on, verdicts are enforced again\",\"secret:1wtwyaz\":\"Turn off inference hooks?\",\"secret:tpgstr\":\"Prompts from your organization will no longer be inspected, and the inference hooks settings become unavailable until you turn this back on. Your endpoint and its headers are kept.\",\"secret:12s8ntj\":\"Inference hooks are still being enabled for another organization. Try again in a moment.\",\"secret:11s4yoh\":\"Enforce verdicts was turned off while enabling inference hooks. Turn it on from the Inference hooks page when you are ready.\",\"secret:1ol6am3\":\"Couldn't turn off Enforce verdicts, so inference hooks stay off for your organization. Try again.\",\"secret:15o5d0v\":\"Inference hooks are on, but Enforce verdicts couldn't be turned off. Turn inference hooks off and try again.\",\"secret:1igzqlb\":\"Inference hooks endpoint is unhealthy\",\"secret:onuhey\":\"The endpoint tripped the circuit breaker, so enforcement was paused. Prompts from your organization aren't being inspected. Review the endpoint, then turn Enforce verdicts back on.\",\"secret:1ozuaxq\":\"Inference hooks are on for {orgName}, but Enforce verdicts couldn't be turned off there. Switch back to that organization and turn inference hooks off.\",\"secret:108wuyj\":\"Endpoint\",\"secret:1ed5im0\":\"Prompts are sent to this endpoint for a verdict before Claude processes them.\",\"secret:1ijl1ag\":\"Inference hooks endpoint\",\"secret:11xybrs\":\"Not configured. Prompts can't be inspected until you set up an endpoint.\",\"secret:1reixy7\":\"{url}{count, plural, =0 {} one { · # custom header} other { · # custom headers}}\",\"secret:1avkmyp\":\"Set up endpoint\",\"secret:15p399m\":\"Configure endpoint\",\"secret:2plvnu\":\"Failure handling\",\"secret:1coag08\":\"1 to 10,000 ms. A slower verdict counts as an unreachable endpoint.\",\"secret:fi4nb9\":\"Request signing\",\"secret:iwrg2p\":\"Endpoint URL\",\"secret:gnb16i\":\"Use an https:// URL.\",\"secret:it82t1\":\"Enter an https:// URL.\",\"secret:17tkl0l\":\"Enter a whole number between {min} and {max}.\",\"secret:wizsmp\":\"Rollout\",\"secret:f953cy\":\"Run inspection on a percentage of requests while you bring your endpoint up.\",\"secret:1at10mb\":\"Requests inspected (%)\",\"secret:f97q60\":\"0 to 100. Each request rolls once for its whole conversation turn; 100 inspects everything, 0 turns inspection off.\",\"secret:xe4jat\":\"Enter a whole number between {min} and {max}.\",\"secret:k1mnde\":\"Rollout is set to 0 — no requests are being inspected.\",\"secret:6c0ses\":\"Inspecting {pct}% of requests\",\"secret:gztp5y\":\"Shadow mode — not blocking\",\"secret:2944wv\":\"Block the request\",\"secret:g3w18m\":\"Stop inference when the endpoint can't be reached.\",\"secret:rj7gzh\":\"Allow the request\",\"secret:164lyug\":\"Let inference proceed without inspection when the endpoint can't be reached.\",\"secret:1k60457\":\"Mode\",\"secret:ob4fh8\":\"Allow the request lets inference proceed without inspection when your endpoint can't be reached or a verdict times out. Block the request stops inference instead.\",\"secret:1a020l0\":\"Shadow mode still calls your endpoint and records its verdict, but always lets the request through.\",\"secret:1wqe8ww\":\"Changes save as you make them.\",\"secret:1o4j9cv\":\"Calls your endpoint and records its verdict, but always allows the request.\",\"secret:15h9on1\":\"Mode before shadow: Allow the request.\",\"secret:7wrvj3\":\"Mode before shadow: Block the request.\",\"secret:1s90i5a\":\"Prompt verdict timeout (ms)\",\"secret:1k7f82l\":\"Cancel\",\"secret:1gwx9b4\":\"Save\",\"secret:12csju6\":\"Circuit breaker tripped\",\"secret:4mx84v\":\"Endpoint status\",\"secret:1x1bebl\":\"Healthy\",\"secret:1ez8gbk\":\"Tripped\",\"secret:i45szt\":\"Not enforcing\",\"secret:yvp3ya\":\"Endpoint health\",\"secret:irehzp\":\"Failures per minute\",\"secret:iwwnpu\":\"≈{count}\",\"secret:1tx3jwn\":\"Block rate\",\"secret:1bjzlri\":\"Recent errors\",\"secret:19fgm2x\":\"Your endpoint tripped the circuit breaker, so all Claude requests for this organization are being rejected. Fix the endpoint, then turn enforcement back on to reset the breaker.\",\"secret:17kranf\":\"Your endpoint tripped the circuit breaker, so prompts are proceeding without inspection. Fix the endpoint, then turn enforcement back on to reset the breaker.\",\"secret:1hja058\":\"Test connection\",\"secret:ptv9o0\":\"Connection successful. The endpoint returned an allow verdict.\",\"secret:1xko4hx\":\"Connection successful. The endpoint returned a deny verdict for the test prompt.\",\"secret:l88i7p\":\"Connection test failed. The endpoint URL was rejected.\",\"secret:xly5nq\":\"Connection test failed. The endpoint address is a private or internal IP. Use a publicly-routable host.\",\"secret:1yvud9m\":\"Connection test failed. The endpoint did not respond within the timeout.\",\"secret:hyww8i\":\"Connection test failed. Could not connect to the endpoint.\",\"secret:vrgcjt\":\"Connection test failed. The endpoint returned an unexpected HTTP status.\",\"secret:o6d2qg\":\"Connection test failed. The endpoint response could not be parsed.\",\"secret:ll2sgp\":\"Connection test failed. {message}\",\"secret:1pcfuta\":\"Couldn't test the connection. Check the URL and try again.\",\"secret:1keqb20\":\"Custom request headers\",\"secret:k59nkd\":\"Sent with every verdict request to authenticate to your endpoint. Values are stored encrypted and never shown again.\",\"secret:1yfmqle\":\"Saved header values are hidden. To save any change, re-enter every value below.\",\"secret:1lxii4c\":\"Header name\",\"secret:blzca\":\"Header value\",\"secret:fr3918\":\"Re-enter to save\",\"secret:eebhgl\":\"Add header\",\"secret:cdemjv\":\"Show value\",\"secret:586ckw\":\"Hide value\",\"secret:1aumcn4\":\"Remove header\",\"secret:17acchn\":\"Enter a header name.\",\"secret:14p9qs9\":\"Header name is too long.\",\"secret:1u5226b\":\"Header names can only contain letters, numbers, and - _ . ~ characters.\",\"secret:1fczce2\":\"This header name is reserved and can't be set.\",\"secret:q69d7t\":\"Enter a value.\",\"secret:1gyle8x\":\"Re-enter this header's value to save.\",\"secret:3ws17v\":\"Header value is too long.\",\"secret:br0qy9\":\"Header values can only contain printable characters.\",\"secret:1sw4c1s\":\"You can configure at most 16 headers.\",\"secret:1wilzi7\":\"Combined header size is too large.\",\"secret:1jhwqph\":\"Header name ''{name}'' is used more than once. Names aren't case-sensitive.\",\"secret:fjxoxf\":\"Changing the endpoint URL cleared your custom headers so they aren't sent to a new destination. Re-enter them below.\",\"secret:1j9scf4\":\"Connection test failed.\",\"secret:14wptdt\":\"To test, re-enter the header values above.\",\"secret:1spmtms\":\"Stored header values cannot be read back, so to test you must re-enter the header values above.\",\"secret:1o7vzkz\":\"Signing secret\",\"secret:qa4j1o\":\"Webhook requests are not signed until you generate a secret.\",\"secret:9mwcit\":\"Requests are signed with your secret. Rotating replaces it immediately.\",\"secret:121cjfl\":\"Generate secret\",\"secret:qe7qrr\":\"Rotate secret\",\"secret:15i3qgd\":\"Rotate signing secret?\",\"secret:1mm2gml\":\"Your current secret stops working as soon as the new one is generated. Webhook requests will fail signature verification until you update your receiver with the new secret.\",\"secret:1ur87de\":\"Signing secret generated\",\"secret:1folpe0\":\"Use this secret to verify the signature on every webhook request.\",\"secret:1i39kzl\":\"The previous secret has stopped working. Update your receiver with this new secret now.\",\"secret:1g52yom\":\"This secret will not be shown again. Copy it and store it securely before closing.\",\"secret:vvkcbl\":\"Copy\",\"secret:jah0hc\":\"Copied\",\"secret:vvkz8u\":\"Done\",\"secret:1st7frw\":\"Could not generate a signing secret. Try again.\",\"secret:n35aab\":\"Configure and test the endpoint that receives prompts for inspection.\",\"secret:k2f83g\":\"Needs setup\",\"secret:1gqf0qt\":\"Unhealthy\",\"secret:1rghia9\":\"Enforcement off\",\"secret:1821u7q\":\"Open Inference hooks settings\",\"secret:epfkzv\":\"Master switch — turning this off stops inspecting every prompt in your organization and disables the settings below.\",\"secret:1xcxv52\":\"Requires endpoint\",\"secret:1499q53\":\"Inference hooks is on, but prompts aren't being inspected yet. Configure and test an endpoint to start.\",\"secret:cxafj\":\"Not configured\",\"secret:1gwodf1\":\"Edit\",\"secret:rpcihy\":\"{url} · Headers: {names}\",\"secret:9quwtu\":\"Custom blocked prompt message\",\"secret:1fs6y8x\":\"Added to the end of the server provided message users see when your endpoint blocks a prompt.\",\"secret:151a77v\":\"Recommended format - Blocked by {orgName}'s {policy} policy (see {policyLink}). Questions? Contact {team} at {email}\",\"secret:1ps023d\":\"Enable custom blocked prompt message\",\"secret:qxsomz\":\"Blocked by your organization's confidential data policy. Questions? Contact your Claude admins.\",\"secret:qxhvq2\":\"Default\",\"secret:16t7enz\":\"Reset to default\",\"secret:cfm9bg\":\"{count} / {max}\",\"secret:hw8p51\":\"Only plain text and line breaks are allowed.\",\"secret:dn2gaq\":\"Exclusions\",\"secret:1arfg5t\":\"Members of excluded roles are not covered by inference hooks — their prompts are never sent to your endpoint.\",\"secret:tt9kyr\":\"Manage roles\",\"secret:niqxvn\":\"Excluded roles\",\"secret:exa72a\":\"Select roles to exclude\",\"secret:az53wm\":\"Could not load your organization’s roles. Try again.\",\"secret:zv5rrs\":\"{count, plural, one {# user excluded} other {# users excluded}}\",\"secret:zqlex7\":\"{userCount, plural, one {# user excluded} other {# users excluded}}, plus members of {groupCount, plural, one {# group} other {# groups}}\",\"secret:qefojr\":\"Members of {count, plural, one {# group} other {# groups}} are excluded.\",\"secret:zmcouw\":\"Could not count excluded users right now.\",\"secret:16y7hy3\":\"The excluded roles have no members yet, so no one is currently excluded.\",\"secret:7kd8x0\":\"Changing exclusions requires identity management permission.\",\"secret:1r9pc6c\":\"Exclusions are managed through roles, which you don’t have permission to view.\",\"secret:66ytjt\":\"Update exclusions?\",\"secret:14uv9xc\":\"{count, plural, one {Adding # role.} other {Adding # roles.}}\",\"secret:1urs82o\":\"{count, plural, one {Removing # role.} other {Removing # roles.}}\",\"secret:1gw37b5\":\"Members of excluded roles are not covered by inference hooks, and role membership changes apply automatically. This change is recorded in your organization’s audit log.\",\"secret:1ivridl\":\"Update\",\"secret:1skaxnp\":\"Exclusions updated\",\"secret:1sc4a86\":\"Some exclusion changes could not be saved. Check the refreshed list and try again.\",\"secret:gjcx5h\":\"Exclusions aren’t available for your organization yet.\",\"secret:va27pq\":\"Plugins\",\"secret:11nu6qj\":\"Plugins to include whenever this profile is added, on top of the scope's own plugins.\",\"secret:370sfl\":\"Add a plugin to this profile\",\"secret:1fihi7g\":\"Couldn't load plugins.\",\"secret:133fjg2\":\"Some marketplaces couldn't be loaded.\",\"secret:v3okaa\":\"Remove this plugin?\",\"secret:zd588n\":\"This plugin isn't in your catalog. It may have been removed, or belong to a marketplace added after this page loaded. Remove it from this profile?\",\"secret:1j0v6qs\":\"Connected Slack workspaces\",\"secret:1pbxhb0\":\"To pair your Slack workspace with your Claude organization, a Slack admin must run “@Claude connect” from the target workspace. This will generate a one-time code (valid for 15 minutes). Paste it here to pair the workspace.\",\"secret:3yueqe\":\"Claim code\",\"secret:1nb0jdh\":\"Paste a code from @Claude connect\",\"secret:xre5qm\":\"Add new\",\"secret:4y4i3r\":\"Pair a Slack workspace\",\"secret:1whfwja\":\"Connect workspace\",\"secret:12z8ryt\":\"Workspace connected.\",\"secret:17fd3c6\":\"Failed to connect workspace. Try again.\",\"secret:1isor15\":\"No workspaces connected yet.\",\"secret:1x9c68a\":\"Failed to load connected workspaces.\",\"secret:1wi1vun\":\"Active\",\"secret:u0xvt1\":\"Disconnected\",\"secret:9ysceh\":\"Connected {date}\",\"secret:mf8kuo\":\"Disconnect\",\"secret:85owuw\":\"Disconnect {workspace}\",\"secret:143epk9\":\"Disconnect workspace?\",\"secret:85phip\":\"Claude usage in {workspace} will no longer be billed to this organization, and all of the workspace's Claude data (sessions, memory, and routines) will be permanently deleted within 30 days. This can't be undone. A workspace admin can reconnect the workspace by sending “@Claude connect” in it, but deleted data won't be restored.\",\"secret:1xl7bpt\":\"Disconnect\",\"secret:r8h4w9\":\"Cancel\",\"secret:qew2lr\":\"Workspace disconnected.\",\"secret:snizt8\":\"Failed to disconnect. Try again.\",\"secret:ukqnvi\":\"Enterprise Grid\",\"secret:mtxu8d\":\"Covers workspaces in this Grid that don't have their own Claude connection.\",\"secret:1978jx8\":\"Disconnect Enterprise Grid?\",\"secret:1qdecur\":\"Copy command\",\"secret:yvd54g\":\"Copied\",\"secret:1wy3glw\":\"Claude usage in workspaces of the {workspace} Grid that don't have their own Claude connection will no longer be billed to this organization, and all of those workspaces' Claude data (sessions, memory, and routines) will be permanently deleted within 30 days. This can't be undone. A Grid organization admin can reconnect the Grid by sending “@Claude connect” in any of its workspaces, but deleted data won't be restored.\",\"secret:1nherao\":\"Enterprise Grid connected.\",\"secret:18pknrq\":\"Enterprise Grid disconnected.\",\"secret:1fft3ce\":\"{count, plural, one {# member} other {# members}}\",\"secret:jgipng\":\"Member list hidden by this group's settings\",\"secret:1ouhleq\":\"No members\",\"secret:phnhfw\":\"Couldn't load members\",\"secret:19yhfvt\":\"Unknown member\",\"secret:1ougyin\":\"+{count} more\",\"secret:mjlk4u\":\"{count}+ members\",\"secret:c8ar25\":\"+ more\",\"secret:17l37w0\":\"Couldn't load group access for this project.\",\"secret:1aaywav\":\"Group\",\"secret:4s5bax\":\"Already has access\",\"secret:1yw9joi\":\"Add people or groups\",\"secret:lpb5pi\":\"People and groups with access\",\"secret:1u11mlh\":\"Search by name, email, or group...\",\"secret:19svoha\":\"Hidden group\",\"secret:14wgfrl\":\"Project shared\",\"secret:1ujrjk1\":\"Notify people\",\"secret:b6ij9p\":\"Notify group\",\"secret:1qhidja\":\"Notify groups\",\"secret:1wtu9oa\":\"Notify people and groups\",\"secret:1fiwkv8\":\"Notifications are turned off for shares that would email more than {cap} people\",\"secret:lo2g75\":\"Only invited members and groups can view and use this project\",\"secret:168lw46\":\"Skill shared\",\"secret:1ejbor8\":\"Couldn't load group access for this skill.\",\"secret:1xoh692\":\"Share with groups\",\"secret:o2nt8q\":\"Allow team members to share skills with groups in your organization.\",\"secret:14jqgdp\":\"Share skills with groups\",\"secret:gef4df\":\"Let members share skills with groups in your organization. Turning this off doesn’t remove previously shared skills.\",\"secret:1qa56ut\":\"Claude needs credentials to continue\",\"secret:1yqmwkl\":\"Connect {partnerName} so Claude can request credentials while working. You approve each request in {partnerName}, and Claude never sees your passwords.\",\"secret:1goviel\":\"Connect {partnerName}\",\"secret:99jev3\":\"{partnerName} is connected\",\"secret:rsak2j\":\"Claude can now request credentials. You approve each one in {partnerName}.\",\"secret:1q21zfp\":\"Couldn't connect to {partnerName}. Check that it's open and that the app and browser extension are up to date, then try again.\",\"secret:l2zw5x\":\"Too many attempts. Quit and reopen Claude to try again.\",\"secret:107hep8\":\"Too many attempts. Wait a few minutes, then try again.\",\"secret:78xf0v\":\"Your {partnerName} administrator has turned this integration off. Ask them to enable it, then try again.\",\"secret:1o0r5tv\":\"Couldn''t reach {partnerName}. Open it and unlock it, then try again.\",\"secret:dtym7y\":\"{partnerName} is open but isn''t accepting connections from Claude. Sign in to {partnerName} if you aren''t already. On {partnerName} Business, ask your administrator to allow AI agents to autofill. Then quit and reopen {partnerName}.\",\"secret:1l7ce4m\":\"Enter your verification code\",\"secret:44lnzo\":\"{siteDomain} {channel, select, sms {sent a verification code to your phone} email {sent a verification code to your email} other {sent you a verification code}}. Enter it here and Claude will type it into the sign-in page for you, instead of repeating it in the chat.\",\"secret:7098se\":\"Enter code\",\"secret:zcee6i\":\"Only enter the code if {siteDomain} is the site you're signing in to. Never enter your password here.\",\"secret:1c4bh7y\":\"That doesn't look like a verification code. Enter it exactly as it was sent to you.\",\"secret:19r4gh2\":\"The code couldn't be entered on {siteDomain}. Claude will ask again if a code is still needed.\",\"secret:pj1dkk\":\"Password managers\",\"secret:1lglx20\":\"Allow team members to connect a password manager so Claude can sign in to sites while working. Each member approves every request in their own password manager, and Claude never sees their passwords.\",\"secret:17tvjar\":\"Give your team {model} and let them keep working when they hit plan limits. Both draw from usage credits, billed separately from your plan. <link>Learn more</link>\",\"secret:a182px\":\"{model} uses your usage credits and draws down usage much faster than Opus.\",\"secret:17u4ygi\":\"Buy usage credits to continue using {model}\",\"secret:1sregmg\":\"Usage credits are billed separately from your plan.\",\"secret:injx4w\":\"Start using {model}\",\"secret:1cabssc\":\"You're now using {toModel}\",\"secret:1kjgiym\":\"To switch back to {fromModel}, buy usage credits anytime.\",\"secret:losuv6\":\"Requires usage credits\",\"secret:wwpz5x\":\"{model} now runs on usage credits. Buy credits to keep using {model} or switch models to continue chatting.\",\"secret:1mv5mnx\":\"You're out of usage credits. Buy more to keep using {model} or switch models to continue this chat.\",\"secret:7qs880\":\"You've hit your spend limit. Adjust it to keep using {model} or switch models to continue chatting.\",\"secret:maqwxi\":\"Usage credits are off. Turn them on to keep using {model} or switch models to continue chatting.\",\"secret:h24rgl\":\"You've reached your {period, select, daily {daily } weekly {weekly } monthly {monthly } other {}}spend limit. Request more to keep using {model}, or switch models to continue chatting.\",\"secret:1m9rkoc\":\"Ask your admin to turn on usage credits to use {model}. You can keep using other models in the meantime.\",\"secret:1g6b9pa\":\"{model} runs on usage credits\",\"secret:1b4asnf\":\"Buy credits to keep using {model} or switch models\",\"secret:fxw77i\":\"{model} now runs on usage credits\",\"secret:1o1tfnn\":\"{model} was included in your plan as a promotion until July 19, and now requires usage credits.\",\"secret:1yod0ea\":\"{model} was included in your plan as a promotion until July 19, and now runs on your usage credits.\",\"secret:p3jdos\":\"{model} was included in your plan as a promotion until July 19, and now requires usage credits.\",\"secret:1g2ehd2\":\"{model} was included in your plan as a promotion until July 19, and now requires usage credits.\",\"secret:hgk1x2\":\"Buy usage credits\",\"secret:1tca6gc\":\"Turn on usage credits to use {model}\",\"secret:1xexkvf\":\"You already have {balance} in usage credits. Turn usage credits back on to start using {model}.\",\"secret:1do5owa\":\"{model} runs on usage credits. Turn usage credits on to start using {model}.\",\"secret:189myag\":\"Request usage credits for {model}\",\"secret:122w3j6\":\"{model} runs on usage credits. Send a request to your admin, and continue using other models in the meantime.\",\"secret:10q4vvr\":\"Switch models to continue chatting.\",\"secret:12yt9io\":\"{model} request sent\",\"secret:5twsju\":\"We've let your admin know you want to use {model}. We'll let you know when it's approved.\",\"secret:1mk81vr\":\"Fable 5 is the most capable model and draws down usage much faster than Opus\",\"secret:14h63kx\":\"Network events\",\"secret:uo84yu\":\"Export network events\",\"secret:1s20zdf\":\"A JSON log of every network request Claude made in the selected hour (UTC), including denied ones. Git and MCP traffic aren't included.\",\"secret:1q3xgiq\":\"Hour\",\"secret:qhci8w\":\"Download\",\"secret:d71d6f\":\"That hour is in the future. Pick the current hour or earlier.\",\"secret:1p468ii\":\"This hour isn't over. More events may be logged.\",\"secret:1asjkcs\":\"No network events found for that hour.\",\"secret:80vjuv\":\"Couldn't download network events. Try again.\",\"secret:1dl3vts\":\"Downloaded {count, plural, one {# event} other {# events}}.\",\"secret:5a39z9\":\"Checking server\",\"secret:13589jl\":\"Checking the server URL\",\"secret:u5cv1i\":\"Connect to the server\",\"secret:1rp8991\":\"Find the authorization server\",\"secret:1rp7y5h\":\"Verifying OAuth configuration\",\"secret:6wwssm\":\"Done\",\"secret:pen8bw\":\"Not found\",\"secret:aj3qti\":\"Skipped\",\"secret:7s2fjb\":\"Couldn't check\",\"secret:cwicgv\":\"Step running\",\"secret:1pf1l3\":\"Step waiting\",\"secret:ejovto\":\"HTTP status {status}\",\"secret:orvdt3\":\"Server found. The next step is pre-filled with what was detected.\",\"secret:phvv5x\":\"This URL can't be checked automatically. You can still configure it manually.\",\"secret:19xrxj9\":\"Couldn't determine the server settings. You can still configure them manually.\",\"secret:tjuhoc\":\"Nothing answered at this URL. Check it for typos before continuing.\",\"secret:101o3uw\":\"A connector with this URL already exists in your organization. Use the existing connector instead of adding it again.\",\"secret:1cf5vue\":\"Tunnel addresses are checked when the connector first connects.\",\"secret:76yc9v\":\"Relay addresses are checked when the connector first connects.\",\"secret:j18wh7\":\"Connector URLs must use https.\",\"secret:rc54hq\":\"This address can't be reached from Claude.\",\"secret:wg187c\":\"Click Next to configure the connector manually.\",\"secret:11pn7fi\":\"Next\",\"secret:1ya52h\":\"Couldn't reach this address\",\"secret:1kre2ut\":\"Connection timed out\",\"secret:zhzd67\":\"The server didn't respond in time\",\"secret:1dmol1y\":\"The connection dropped before a response arrived\",\"secret:1wmmpw8\":\"The server sent an invalid response\",\"secret:imtlq1\":\"The server's response was too large\",\"secret:vnytyy\":\"Some checks were skipped because the server took longer than 5 seconds. The settings below may need adjusting.\",\"secret:hsjls3\":\"Detected\",\"secret:16qxkb8\":\"When Claude checked this server, it required sign-in — that’s why ‘Always required’ is tagged Detected. Without sign-in, this connector will likely fail to connect. If the server uses an API key instead of OAuth, add it as a request header below.\",\"secret:2mbuhf\":\"When Claude checked this server, it required sign-in — that’s why ‘Always required’ is tagged Detected. Without sign-in, this connector will likely fail to connect.\",\"secret:1he9onq\":\"This server requires sign-in, but authentication is set to None, so connecting will likely fail for everyone in your organization.\",\"secret:1stw7gp\":\"Add anyway\",\"secret:1bdol4f\":\"Configure Claude for this channel\",\"secret:qq3jmi\":\"Anyone in this Slack channel can set instructions for how Claude behaves here. Changes apply to new sessions started in the channel.\",\"secret:1nszkcm\":\"Channel instructions\",\"secret:1rsjpth\":\"Added to Claude's instructions for every new session in this channel, alongside any instructions set by your organization's admins.\",\"secret:11hlps5\":\"e.g. Answer as this team's on-call helper. Keep replies brief and link to our runbooks.\",\"secret:qqd1ja\":\"Save\",\"secret:1bczpy6\":\"Saved. Changes apply to new sessions in this channel.\",\"secret:1jss8t2\":\"Couldn't save channel instructions. You can try again.\",\"secret:zwafbh\":\"Couldn't load this channel's configuration. Refresh the page to try again.\",\"secret:12pusx6\":\"Connections\",\"secret:1voylzv\":\"Services Claude can reach for sessions in this channel. Set by your organization’s admins.\",\"secret:12m87cz\":\"No connections configured.\",\"secret:1jzylvo\":\"Channel instructions can only be edited by your organization’s admins.\",\"secret:1ov2v8r\":\"Claude Tag\",\"secret:bni431\":\"Enable {product} for your organization\",\"secret:1a755iw\":\"Allow your organization to tag Claude and hand off tasks in external apps.\",\"secret:qftdvd\":\"Set up {product}\",\"secret:18rxwnw\":\"Let members of your organization work with Claude Tag in Slack channels.\",\"secret:1mfmpz2\":\"{product} in Slack\",\"secret:5hv6t8\":\"Members can message Claude privately. DM usage counts against their own Claude limits, not your organization's {product} usage.\",\"secret:1wo1idi\":\"Turn on {product} to change this.\",\"secret:igto6z\":\"Allow Claude to work in channels with guests\",\"secret:lb1ey\":\"Let Claude respond in channels that include guests or people from outside your Slack workspace.\",\"secret:16eiv3b\":\"Allow Slack guests?\",\"secret:1dh5ws3\":\"{product} can read public channels and public channel memory. Allowing guest access means Slack guests can use {product} and may see content from those sources, including channels they weren't explicitly added to.\",\"secret:12999wf\":\"Allow guests\",\"secret:10nqtzp\":\"Guest access is on{inherited, select, true { (inherited)} other {}}. Slack guests can use {product}, which can read public channels and public channel memory. Guests may see content from channels they weren't explicitly added to.\",\"secret:72h7c3\":\"Only allow users on your organization's verified domains to connect Claude accounts to your Slack enterprise.\",\"secret:13dlgm0\":\"Where {product} works\",\"secret:1jtdjaz\":\"Connect the apps where your organization can tag Claude.\",\"secret:11b59an\":\"{count, plural, one {# enterprise grid} other {# enterprise grids}}\",\"secret:pgby8c\":\"{count, plural, one {# workspace} other {# workspaces}}\",\"secret:1wieiml\":\"{items} connected\",\"secret:scxmhr\":\"Disconnected · {name}\",\"secret:1f3eu0d\":\"Not connected · {name}\",\"secret:1fsqpy3\":\"Reconnect {name}\",\"secret:xykddj\":\"Connect Slack\",\"secret:6hoepo\":\"Connect a Slack workspace to configure access.\",\"secret:pnusym\":\"Connect GitHub so {product} can work with your organization's code.\",\"secret:l4fgio\":\"GitHub: {count, plural, one {# org connected} other {# orgs connected}}\",\"secret:1bmqx24\":\"{product}'s access\",\"secret:2ee7iw\":\"Define what {product} can access in different apps.\",\"secret:1ql0xa2\":\"Define what {product} can access for all connected apps and Claude Code cloud sessions. This access is inherited everywhere members of your organization tag Claude.\",\"secret:c632wj\":\"Access bundles applied organization-wide\",\"secret:1ny718q\":\"Stop applying {name}\",\"secret:164njd2\":\"Define what {product} can access in Slack. This access is inherited in all workspaces and channels where members of your organization tag Claude.\",\"secret:zlf201\":\"Define what Claude can access for all conversations in {name}. This access is inherited in all channels where members of your organization tag Claude.\",\"secret:3ruuur\":\"Define what Claude can access in {name}.\",\"secret:wzzmy8\":\"Resolved access from all inherited access bundles and config\",\"secret:8ed2j\":\"Include specific instructions in Claude's system prompt for this {scope}\",\"secret:p1ulzr\":\"Advanced\",\"secret:1azb0p\":\"Access bundles control what Claude can reach and how it works.\",\"secret:z36152\":\"No access bundles yet. Create one to give Claude credentials, repos, and instructions you can reuse across scopes.\",\"secret:z9l4i8\":\"Credentials in this bundle will be deleted, and any scope that inherits it will lose that access.\",\"secret:euqn7g\":\"Give Claude credentials to access the apps that your org uses.\",\"secret:15gfp2k\":\"You connect these with your own account or token. Claude uses it for anyone in this channel and can reach whatever that credential can, so scope it to what this channel should see.\",\"secret:tjsmaf\":\"Give Claude access to GitHub repositories.\",\"secret:n84g2u\":\"Install the GitHub App to connect repositories.\",\"secret:d0igv4\":\"Install the Claude GitHub App on your GitHub organization to add repos to this access bundle.\",\"secret:l16nfe\":\"A GitHub org owner can set this up for your entire org.\",\"secret:13mporc\":\"Get started with GitHub\",\"secret:q8dvj4\":\"Install the Claude GitHub App on an organization on {hostname} to add repos to this access bundle.\",\"secret:7plz4q\":\"An admin on your GitHub Enterprise instance can install the app on each organization there.\",\"secret:7ppou7\":\"Looking for {hostname}? Switch the GitHub instance above.\",\"secret:3i7bcx\":\"The Claude GitHub App may not be installed on that organization on {hostname} yet.\",\"secret:gmui16\":\"Repository search isn’t available on this host yet. Search by account name.\",\"secret:1ngl45f\":\"The Claude GitHub App may not have access to it yet. Ask a {orgName} admin to add it on the installation's settings page on your GitHub Enterprise instance. If you recently requested access, it may still be awaiting admin approval.\",\"secret:p5s6g9\":\"Give Claude access to specific domains and ports without credentials. Wildcards are allowed as the leftmost label (*.example.com).\",\"secret:ajcqma\":\"Allowed methods\",\"secret:2mnmib\":\"Only checked methods are allowed. Git clone and MCP servers need POST.\",\"secret:2mrnvu\":\"Select at least one method\",\"secret:2op6j6\":\"Hosts already on the environment's base allowlist keep all methods.\",\"secret:nrobnq\":\"Advanced · {summary}\",\"secret:16vzar1\":\"Read-only (GET, HEAD, OPTIONS)\",\"secret:xwajus\":\"{count, plural, one {# method} other {# methods}}\",\"secret:1s1lr9j\":\"This matches only www.{rest}. Use {rest} for the bare domain or *.{rest} to include all subdomains.\",\"secret:1067n7h\":\"Blocked domains\",\"secret:x8jnd8\":\"Requests matching these entries are blocked for this bundle before its allowed domains are considered. Rules added outside this dialog at higher precedence can still match first.\",\"secret:1clp4mu\":\"All domains\",\"secret:1suu8q3\":\"Custom condition\",\"secret:1lndxjy\":\"Edit blocked domains\",\"secret:dhfrew\":\"Path patterns\",\"secret:1pe80xz\":\"Invalid domain. Use a domain like api.example.com or *.example.com, or * to match all domains.\",\"secret:929z38\":\"Invalid pattern. Enter a valid regular expression.\",\"secret:19gpysg\":\"Blocked domains updated.\",\"secret:1jx59wk\":\"Couldn't save the blocked domains. Try again.\",\"secret:1guo9k\":\"Remove blocked domains?\",\"secret:17koj2p\":\"Requests matching this entry will no longer be blocked for this bundle.\",\"secret:12r6t6l\":\"Couldn't remove the blocked domains. Try again.\",\"secret:5m1dco\":\"Let Claude use specific plugins.\",\"secret:1i17j6r\":\"Include specific instructions in Claude's system prompt when this bundle is used.\",\"secret:3usavi\":\"Skip the write-up: record your screen and Claude builds the skill.\",\"secret:65x87h\":\"Show, don't tell\",\"secret:pe7dzh\":\"Instead of describing each step of your skill, record your screen while you do the task once. Claude builds the skill from what it sees.\",\"secret:1an8on9\":\"Record a skill\",\"secret:1m8pq6c\":\"{model}''s safeguards flagged this message. Our intentionally broad safeguards allow us to deliver more capabilities faster, but can sometimes flag legitimate cybersecurity work. <formLink>Apply to the Cyber Verification Program</formLink> to reduce these interruptions.\",\"secret:tpwkhq\":\"{model}''s safeguards flagged this message. Our intentionally broad safeguards allow us to deliver more capabilities faster, but can sometimes flag legitimate coding, cybersecurity, and biology tasks.\",\"secret:1fcctj0\":\"Delete\",\"secret:t4f8r3\":\"Delete this finding?\",\"secret:1fc88wb\":\"This removes the finding and its details permanently. A future scan can report it again.\",\"secret:1293ph3\":\"Delete finding\",\"secret:1fc9j3f\":\"Finding deleted.\",\"secret:17ojskm\":\"Failed to delete finding. You can try again.\",\"secret:176bxm7\":\"This skill will be ready to use after it passes a <a0>security scan</a0>. This usually takes 1–2 minutes.\",\"secret:tjcjq4\":\"The security scan found something in this skill that couldn’t be confirmed. Only use this skill if you trust the source. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:1lnnmny\":\"The security scan found that this skill may {reason}. Only use this skill if you trust the source. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:19cmi4w\":\"This skill can’t be used because it didn’t pass the security scan. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:1oyu0aa\":\"This skill can’t be used. It didn’t pass the security scan because it {reason}. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:15bnavi\":\"This skill can’t be used because it didn’t pass the security scan. Contact your admin\",\"secret:vbx90s\":\"This skill was turned off. It didn’t pass the security scan because it {reason}. Contact your admin\",\"secret:blwdnu\":\"Couldn’t complete the <a0>security scan</a0> for this skill.\",\"secret:wdpxvu\":\"Something went wrong during the <a0>security scan</a0>.\",\"secret:1slmt7q\":\"Couldn’t read the uploaded file. Re-upload the skill to try again.\",\"secret:yo9vrv\":\"The <a0>security scan</a0> was cancelled.\",\"secret:14y9f6l\":\"In review\",\"secret:84f4sw\":\"Caution\",\"secret:8449t4\":\"Blocked\",\"secret:18q3l2p\":\"Not reviewed\",\"secret:16ghvky\":\"Retry\",\"secret:1txyncb\":\"Delete\",\"secret:1uqn1dc\":\"You can turn this skill on after the security scan completes.\",\"secret:xvwepb\":\"This skill didn’t pass the security scan.\",\"secret:m50j64\":\"{skillName} will be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:dhi058\":\"{skillName} was replaced. It’ll be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:17bdkt6\":\"{count, plural, one {# skill} other {# skills}} will be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:2bbemo\":\"{skillName} was created. It’ll be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:8hbuxd\":\"{skillName} was saved. It’ll be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:1vnre30\":\"Skill saved. It’ll be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes). \",\"secret:1yajggo\":\"Updated “{skillName}”. It’ll be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:rq6n3v\":\"Restored “{skillName}” to its previous version. It’ll be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:16w8ct9\":\"{skillName} is ready to use.\",\"secret:1mee9kc\":\"After upload, your skill goes through a brief <a0>security scan</a0> (usually 1–2 minutes) before it’s ready to use. <a1>Learn more about skills</a1> or <a2>see an example</a2>.\",\"secret:17coag\":\"A security scan runs when you save.\",\"secret:1hea2kf\":\"Security scan\",\"secret:1g4okx5\":\"Runs when you save\",\"secret:1hhndbi\":\"Ready — runs when you save\",\"secret:1buyj2j\":\"Skill and plugin security scanning\",\"secret:1p24scl\":\"Run a scan on skills and plugins when they’re uploaded to catch possible security concerns. Any that don’t pass the scan are blocked from use.\",\"secret:zhtru5\":\"sends information about you and your activity to an outside service without telling you\",\"secret:1dbmm5n\":\"sends your files or messages to an outside service you didn’t choose\",\"secret:11zd5m9\":\"downloads and runs instructions from the internet that can change after this scan\",\"secret:n5wg8r\":\"contains or collects sign-in details like passwords and access keys\",\"secret:1aa7tah\":\"tries to turn off safeguards or trick you into approving actions you haven’t reviewed\",\"secret:1xv4b14\":\"imitates Claude’s own instructions or makes up safeguards\",\"secret:lwqk5h\":\"changes or deletes your data without telling you in ways you may not be able to undo\",\"secret:6gcfu3\":\"changes how Claude acts without telling you\",\"secret:1b3rirr\":\"runs code that hides what it actually does\",\"secret:1kflpvt\":\"adds promotional links, ads, or branding to your work without telling you\",\"secret:1u0cljf\":\"secretly checks your account and works differently depending on who you are\",\"secret:1qvtdim\":\"can delete your files or set itself up to keep running after you remove it\",\"secret:1thjjk5\":\"send information about you and your activity to an outside service without telling you\",\"secret:1k7xphf\":\"send your files or messages to an outside service you didn’t choose\",\"secret:1ojzvbd\":\"download and run instructions from the internet that can change after this scan\",\"secret:1r49xnn\":\"contain or collect sign-in details like passwords and access keys\",\"secret:f7h8q9\":\"try to turn off safeguards or trick you into approving actions you haven’t reviewed\",\"secret:stq0s0\":\"imitate Claude’s own instructions or make up safeguards\",\"secret:s9gpv1\":\"change or delete your data without telling you in ways you may not be able to undo\",\"secret:1pcn8w3\":\"change how Claude acts without telling you\",\"secret:fzrokv\":\"run code that hides what it actually does\",\"secret:19w1ar5\":\"add promotional links, ads, or branding to your work without telling you\",\"secret:q1xlsz\":\"secretly check your account and work differently depending on who you are\",\"secret:1x8jj86\":\"delete your files or set itself up to keep running after you remove it\",\"secret:1yfd224\":\"This skill will be ready to use after it passes a security scan. This usually takes 1–2 minutes.\",\"secret:15gvnj3\":\"The security scan found something in this skill that couldn’t be confirmed. Only use this skill if you trust the source.\",\"secret:wdyttp\":\"The security scan found that this skill may {reason}. Only use this skill if you trust the source.\",\"secret:1y4w5wr\":\"This skill can’t be used because it didn’t pass the security scan.\",\"secret:klosjt\":\"This skill can’t be used. It didn’t pass the security scan because it {reason}.\",\"secret:68au6p\":\"Couldn’t complete the security scan for this skill.\",\"secret:j6r54h\":\"Something went wrong during the security scan.\",\"secret:17pqps0\":\"The security scan was cancelled.\",\"secret:c9y6kv\":\"After upload, your skill goes through a brief security scan (usually 1–2 minutes) before it’s ready to use. <a1>Learn more about skills</a1> or <a2>see an example</a2>.\",\"secret:npcy61\":\"In review\",\"secret:1v0z5yk\":\"Caution\",\"secret:1v0oays\":\"Blocked\",\"secret:79xbf9\":\"Not reviewed\",\"secret:ubxuri\":\"Retry\",\"secret:1ista65\":\"Delete\",\"secret:32d1vv\":\"This plugin will be ready to use after it passes a <a0>security scan</a0>. This usually takes 1–2 minutes.\",\"secret:1iy1prs\":\"The security scan found something in this plugin that couldn’t be confirmed. Only use this plugin if you trust the source. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:14ftlcq\":\"The security scan found that this plugin may {reason}. Only use this plugin if you trust the source. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:58nmek\":\"This plugin can’t be used because it didn’t pass the security scan. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:5tvky6\":\"This plugin can’t be used. It didn’t pass the security scan because it {reason}. <a0>Learn more</a0>\",\"secret:17of56\":\"This plugin can’t be used because it didn’t pass the security scan. Contact your admin\",\"secret:1b82vns\":\"This plugin was turned off. It didn’t pass the security scan because it {reason}. Contact your admin\",\"secret:196u5zi\":\"Couldn’t complete the <a0>security scan</a0> for this plugin.\",\"secret:1uvr90u\":\"Something went wrong during the <a0>security scan</a0>.\",\"secret:hejhvm\":\"Couldn’t read the uploaded file. Re-upload the plugin to try again.\",\"secret:1x6b6wv\":\"The <a0>security scan</a0> was cancelled.\",\"secret:tagrpw\":\"You can turn this plugin on after the security scan completes.\",\"secret:1nalkqz\":\"This plugin didn’t pass the security scan.\",\"secret:tc9umx\":\"You can customize this plugin after the security scan completes.\",\"secret:m4jxc1\":\"{pluginName} is ready to use.\",\"secret:x1gh4g\":\"{pluginName} will be ready to use after a quick security scan (1–2 minutes).\",\"secret:tzlid3\":\"{count, plural, one {# plugin from {marketplaceName} is ready to use.} other {# plugins from {marketplaceName} are ready to use.}}\",\"secret:4qf4nm\":\"{count, plural, one {# plugin from {marketplaceName} was reviewed} other {# plugins from {marketplaceName} were reviewed}}, and {flagged, plural, one {# was} other {# were}} flagged. Check before using.\",\"secret:z9da54\":\"{ready, plural, one {# of {count} plugins from {marketplaceName} is ready to use.} other {# of {count} plugins from {marketplaceName} are ready to use.}} {undecided, plural, one {# couldn’t be reviewed. Check it before using.} other {# couldn’t be reviewed. Check them before using.}}\",\"secret:uwzyb4\":\"{count, plural, one {# plugin from {marketplaceName} couldn’t be reviewed. Check it before using.} other {# plugins from {marketplaceName} couldn’t be reviewed. Check them before using.}}\",\"secret:vukbrx\":\"Of {count} plugins from {marketplaceName}, {flagged, plural, one {# was flagged} other {# were flagged}} and {undecided} couldn’t be reviewed. Check before using.\",\"secret:frrp73\":\"Delete plugin?\",\"secret:rzukej\":\"This plugin will be permanently removed from your uploads.\",\"secret:118vb49\":\"sends information about you and your activity to an outside service without telling you\",\"secret:19q64jr\":\"sends your files or messages to an outside service you didn’t choose\",\"secret:1qopt3h\":\"downloads and runs instructions from the internet that can change after this scan\",\"secret:pyufvj\":\"contains or collects sign-in details like passwords and access keys\",\"secret:1d35sx9\":\"tries to turn off safeguards or trick you into approving actions you haven’t reviewed\",\"secret:l1sc4\":\"imitates Claude’s own instructions or makes up safeguards\",\"secret:55y3vt\":\"changes or deletes your data without telling you in ways you may not be able to undo\",\"secret:1jmqvbb\":\"changes how Claude acts without telling you\",\"secret:16ktmqz\":\"runs code that hides what it actually does\",\"secret:14x9bzh\":\"adds promotional links, ads, or branding to your work without telling you\",\"secret:ave67b\":\"secretly checks your account and works differently depending on who you are\",\"secret:1a50x8y\":\"can delete your files or set itself up to keep running after you remove it\",\"secret:1v8l2u9\":\"send information about you and your activity to an outside service without telling you\",\"secret:1gmh7vj\":\"send your files or messages to an outside service you didn’t choose\",\"secret:e88gth\":\"download and run instructions from the internet that can change after this scan\",\"secret:1tx7xaf\":\"contain or collect sign-in details like passwords and access keys\",\"secret:i0f8d1\":\"try to turn off safeguards or trick you into approving actions you haven’t reviewed\",\"secret:ukrk24\":\"imitate Claude’s own instructions or make up safeguards\",\"secret:bio9ld\":\"change or delete your data without telling you in ways you may not be able to undo\",\"secret:13hxme7\":\"change how Claude acts without telling you\",\"secret:bgtsk3\":\"run code that hides what it actually does\",\"secret:udowut\":\"add promotional links, ads, or branding to your work without telling you\",\"secret:15y38fz\":\"secretly check your account and work differently depending on who you are\",\"secret:1ghr2yi\":\"delete your files or set itself up to keep running after you remove it\",\"secret:wz6seo\":\"This plugin will be ready to use after it passes a security scan. This usually takes 1–2 minutes.\",\"secret:kp781v\":\"The security scan found something in this plugin that couldn’t be confirmed. Only use this plugin if you trust the source.\",\"secret:1oxh7vl\":\"The security scan found that this plugin may {reason}. Only use this plugin if you trust the source.\",\"secret:wopw9b\":\"This plugin can’t be used because it didn’t pass the security scan.\",\"secret:4n1ijx\":\"This plugin can’t be used. It didn’t pass the security scan because it {reason}.\",\"secret:vn008d\":\"Couldn’t complete the security scan for this plugin.\",\"secret:1fm8l1p\":\"Something went wrong during the security scan.\",\"secret:5443q4\":\"The security scan was cancelled.\",\"secret:f6eg4c\":\"Fable is the most capable model and draws down usage much faster than Opus\",\"secret:dkinrc\":\"Fable now runs on usage credits—here''s {amount} in credits on us\",\"secret:1ap9h0k\":\"Fable was included in your plan as a promotion until July 19, and now requires usage credits. Claim {amount} in free credits to keep using it without interruption.\",\"secret:r6gubq\":\"Claim them so your team can keep using Fable without interruption. Usage credits also cover members if they hit a plan limit. Free credits are used first, and you're only billed if you buy more.\",\"secret:16t4ylr\":\"Organization library\",\"secret:8p6874\":\"Create a plugin\",\"secret:pyp392\":\"Create a skill\",\"secret:10dvoo4\":\"Write the files in your browser\",\"secret:dg1aw6\":\"Overview\",\"secret:1ubrgg7\":\"Contents\",\"secret:1hoior7\":\"Slash command\",\"secret:ahigwx\":\"Version\",\"secret:lh2gsf\":\"Published\",\"secret:jwfrde\":\"Remove from library\",\"secret:14ncact\":\"Remove “{name}” from the library?\",\"secret:1i03my5\":\"This permanently deletes the skill and all of its versions for everyone in your organization. People who have it turned on lose it right away. This can’t be undone.\",\"secret:l8ad95\":\"Removed from the library.\",\"secret:1lb78pd\":\"Couldn’t remove the skill from the library. Try again.\",\"secret:1q07bqn\":\"Couldn’t load all of the published skills.\",\"secret:1pv191n\":\"Plugins available to Claude for sessions in this channel.\",\"secret:ic4wjn\":\"Added by members\",\"secret:1330321\":\"Added by your admin\",\"secret:1bprwfb\":\"Adding plugins from this page isn’t enabled yet. No changes were saved.\",\"secret:vqjxl0\":\"Add plugin\",\"secret:7jf7wc\":\"Search plugins\",\"secret:1vv2hqi\":\"Loading plugins…\",\"secret:13cihu\":\"Couldn’t load plugins. Try again.\",\"secret:f4avxd\":\"No more plugins\",\"secret:1vb1tuf\":\"Couldn’t add the plugin. Try again.\",\"secret:8byi4y\":\"No plugins configured.\",\"secret:ckcjy8\":\"Couldn’t remove the plugin. Try again.\",\"secret:ksttkt\":\"You’ve reached your session limit\",\"secret:2ybrz1\":\"Your 5-hour limit resets at {resetTime}. You can wait, or upgrade for more usage.\",\"secret:1gpbn87\":\"Ok\",\"secret:li2va8\":\"Your first reset is free\",\"secret:1qjtel6\":\"You’ve hit your session limit for the first time. It resets at {resetTime}, or you can keep going now.\",\"secret:oe3n8u\":\"One per account.\",\"secret:l8rw04\":\"Claim your free reset\",\"secret:12hghhr\":\"No thanks\",\"secret:kat7dp\":\"Unlock more usage\",\"secret:q1szyd\":\"Your one-time reset was used. You’re good to keep going.\",\"secret:1j3v4j3\":\"On-call\",\"secret:h78tor\":\"Claude Tag on-call\",\"secret:pl5fqm\":\"Claude Tag On-call\",\"secret:h1aa8v\":\"Claude joins incident channels and watches systems in the background. Each on-call is an access bundle carrying the tools, repos and credentials Claude uses in those channels.\",\"secret:xwn3kr\":\"Set up a new on-call\",\"secret:1kt363i\":\"On-call is set up\",\"secret:1kjuiqd\":\"{count, plural, one {# on-call} other {# on-calls}}\",\"secret:1md9z1q\":\"Pick incident response or monitoring, choose the channel, and Claude takes it from there.\",\"secret:1510jjj\":\"New on-call\",\"secret:ivv3p5\":\"Step {current} of {total}\",\"secret:1l89tvg\":\"Edit\",\"secret:1n9r5yk\":\"Edit {name}\",\"secret:1rc80kz\":\"This on-call covers these channels workspace-wide, so they can't be removed individually.\",\"secret:8z3y6o\":\"Edit on-call\",\"secret:m8pqij\":\"Save changes\",\"secret:1qm740t\":\"Auto-join is on for channels matching <code>{patterns}</code>.\",\"secret:oxtiom\":\"No auto-join pattern is set on this on-call’s workspaces.\",\"secret:oxtits\":\"Auto-join patterns are managed in the workspace’s <link>advanced settings</link>.\",\"secret:13y76d5\":\"Switch to monitor\",\"secret:11st7o3\":\"Switch to incident\",\"secret:10hvdyw\":\"Set up Claude Tag for on-call\",\"secret:1ufj1r5\":\"Set up Claude Tag for On-call\",\"secret:1r19ca9\":\"Bring Claude into Slack to help your team triage incidents, starting before anyone tags it.\",\"secret:1wo1qwn\":\"Watch your alerts and start triage\",\"secret:1dgh9ev\":\"Join incident channels automatically\",\"secret:dnw7te\":\"Claude watches your monitoring tools and posts what it finds in a channel you choose.\",\"secret:1kkuk2q\":\"Claude joins new channels matching a pattern you set, like incident-, as they are created, and starts investigating without being tagged.\",\"secret:10ftusv\":\"First {amount} of usage on us\",\"secret:10hsskn\":\"Terms apply\",\"secret:1j41r0p\":\"Required setup\",\"secret:n1k9vj\":\"About 4 minutes\",\"secret:1ym326r\":\"Start setup\",\"secret:wuynnk\":\"Picking channels adds Claude to them right away; nothing else changes for your team until you launch in the last step. Leave anytime and pick up where you left off.\",\"secret:1kfail5\":\"Set up your first on-call\",\"secret:gz2dz4\":\"No on-calls yet. Set one up and it appears here.\",\"secret:r6lc4j\":\"FAQs\",\"secret:t9pxxy\":\"What can Claude see in Slack?\",\"secret:t9pxk6\":\"Claude reads messages in the channels it's in, including any it's not tagged in. When someone asks it to search or do research, Claude can also look across your workspace's public channels, the same way any member could. Claude can't see into a private channel from outside it—what's said there is visible to Claude only in that channel. For conversations in a private channel, Claude is not allowed to post outside of the channel.\",\"secret:t9pxxz\":\"Does Claude respond only when someone tags it?\",\"secret:t9pxk7\":\"Claude will reply when someone tags it in a channel. It also follows the conversation between tags, and may sometimes join in untagged when it thinks it can help. If you'd rather Claude stay quiet until tagged, you can tell it so for each channel.\",\"secret:t9pxy0\":\"Does Claude Tag use my accounts to do its work?\",\"secret:t9pxk8\":\"<p>No. In channels, Claude uses its own account in each tool, set up by you here. Everything it does shows up as Claude—not as you or whoever set it up—and you control what those accounts can reach.</p><p>GitHub is the one exception to the pattern: you sign in with your own GitHub account once to authorize your GitHub organization and install the Claude GitHub App. Then you choose exactly which repositories Claude can use.</p>\",\"secret:t9pxy1\":\"Can Claude Tag use the connectors we've already set up in Claude?\",\"secret:t9pxk9\":\"No. Connectors in someone's own Claude settings are personal—they act as that person and work only for them. In a Slack channel, everyone works with the same Claude, so it needs shared tools with accounts of its own, and you connect those here. You'll set up each tool once for your organization, even if people already use it in their own Claude.\",\"secret:t9pxy2\":\"Who can set this up?\",\"secret:t9pxka\":\"<p>Two roles are involved. On the Slack side, a Slack workspace admin or owner connects Claude to your workspace. On the Claude side, an owner of your Claude organization sets up Claude's tools and access here.</p><p>Some steps can involve other people too. Connecting GitHub requires someone who manages your GitHub organization. And for other tools, you can send a link to whoever on your team holds that tool's credentials. They don't need to be an organization owner, and you approve what they add.</p>\",\"secret:t9pxy3\":\"How much does this cost?\",\"secret:t9pxkb\":\"<p>Claude Tag is available on Team and Enterprise plans, and it's billed by usage—you pay for the work Claude does, not per seat.{hasPromo, select, true { Your first {amount} is free until {date}.} other {}}</p><p>Work Claude does in channels is billed to your organization. When someone messages Claude in a DM instead, that usage counts against their own Claude limits, not your organization's Claude Tag usage.</p>\",\"secret:t9pxy4\":\"What happens if we hit our spend limit?\",\"secret:t9pxkc\":\"<p>Claude stops taking on new work in Slack and says so in the channel. It will start responding again when your spend limit resets at the start of the next month, or if you raise the limit.</p><p>You'll be alerted as you approach your spend limit. If you don't set a limit, there's no cap at all.{hasPromo, select, true { When your free usage runs out or expires, billing starts. Until then, your spend stays at {zero}.} other {}}</p>\",\"secret:t9pxy5\":\"Can we choose which model Claude Tag uses?\",\"secret:t9pxkd\":\"Yes. You can set the model Claude uses in these settings—for the whole workspace or for specific channels. People in Slack can't switch models themselves, so whatever you choose here is what everyone gets.\",\"secret:t9pxy6\":\"Is our Slack data used to train models?\",\"secret:t9pxke\":\"No. Conversations with Claude Tag aren't used to train our models. They're also kept separate from people's own Claude accounts—what happens in Slack doesn't appear in anyone's Claude history, and conversations people have with Claude elsewhere don't appear in Slack.\",\"secret:davkqy\":\"marcus\",\"secret:1txilg6\":\"lydia\",\"secret:1csp9va\":\"Claude\",\"secret:j63lgr\":\"# triage\",\"secret:1i28b5q\":\"Why are we seeing fewer completed checkouts? Is there an issue on that page\",\"secret:1aa7aht\":\"<mention>@Claude</mention> Good q - Claude can you graph timeouts on the checkout API\",\"secret:owxdju\":\"Pulling checkout API latency from Datadog\",\"secret:1i5sxpg\":\"Pulled checkout API latency from Datadog\",\"secret:1u1xeqj\":\"Correlating with recent deploys\",\"secret:1imuk3n\":\"Correlated with deploy 4h ago\",\"secret:105tdy4\":\"Rendering chart\",\"secret:1j3w6hu\":\"Rendered chart\",\"secret:xy0fh1\":\"Last hour\",\"secret:18vujtp\":\"Baseline\",\"secret:7axk84\":\"Looking at what PRs caused the change\",\"secret:mwg7ma\":\"Not deployed\",\"secret:sb5r96\":\"Not assigned to a channel yet\",\"secret:1sdgeg5\":\"{product} is turned off for your organization. Turn it back on from the {product} settings page first.\",\"secret:7kch6w\":\"Available after your organization switches to Claude Tag.\",\"secret:184t270\":\"Couldn’t load on-calls.\",\"secret:11jzb5u\":\"Connect it first and on-call will use the same workspace.\",\"secret:adk8cf\":\"Connect Slack\",\"secret:xjnteo\":\"Pair your Slack workspace\",\"secret:qa1749\":\"This links your organization's Claude account to Slack. Claude will join Slack like a new member with its own profile.\",\"secret:vu0gw\":\"<link>Add the Claude app</link> to Slack\",\"secret:9429ur\":\"Send this message in any channel\",\"secret:1xcwhzs\":\"Paste the pairing code\",\"secret:bred3v\":\"Copy command\",\"secret:q6e0t8\":\"Copy install link\",\"secret:9g4vru\":\"Pairing code\",\"secret:r0p042\":\"workspace_a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6\",\"secret:k915wp\":\"Connected to {workspace}\",\"secret:1s3sriv\":\"Enter the pairing code from Slack to continue.\",\"secret:12qpgxh\":\"Failed to connect workspace. Try again.\",\"secret:uilw8\":\"Pair workspace\",\"secret:qa314z\":\"Pair your Slack workspace to continue.\",\"secret:1vhkrz4\":\"Your Slack workspace is connected.\",\"secret:h6ox0e\":\"Set a monthly spend limit\",\"secret:1uzt4wb\":\"Cap what Claude Tag can spend each month. You can change this anytime from Usage settings.\",\"secret:1adrzwm\":\"Set monthly spend limits\",\"secret:16qhzgf\":\"You’ll be billed for usage up to your monthly spend limit.\",\"secret:1ehe73n\":\"Unlimited\",\"secret:dar9y7\":\"Custom\",\"secret:cnqyfo\":\"Custom monthly limit\",\"secret:1phwhcn\":\"You only pay for what Claude actually does — most teams like yours use $200–$400 a month. If Claude hits the cap, it stops working until next month, so set it higher than you expect to use.\",\"secret:1975qlu\":\"$0 is allowed — Claude uses the free credit, then pauses until you raise the limit. Nothing is billed.\",\"secret:v8th3e\":\"Limits under $500 stop Claude mid-month for 1 in 3 teams (median overage month: $150 past the cap). You’ll get a heads-up at 80% either way — consider $500+.\",\"secret:196tt6v\":\"Good pick — you only pay for what Claude actually does (most teams like yours: $200–$400 a month), and this cap leaves room for a busy month. We’ll warn you at 80% before anything stops.\",\"secret:1cqzmtt\":\"Couldn’t save the spend limit. Try again.\",\"secret:1h4rjdj\":\"Enter a dollar amount, like 2,500.\",\"secret:bh7cs0\":\"Enter an amount of $1,000,000 or less, or choose Unlimited for no limit.\",\"secret:bv0kzp\":\"Sets a {amount}/month cap.\",\"secret:d62la4\":\"Failed to turn on Claude. Try again.\",\"secret:1my64su\":\"Couldn’t turn on Claude. Try again from Settings.\",\"secret:2xsx1e\":\"Spend limits can’t be set here for this organization — manage them from Usage settings.\",\"secret:25ok9b\":\"Let members know when they can tag Claude\",\"secret:qj9j2z\":\"One message after launch, no follow-ups. Members can use Claude either way once it's live.\",\"secret:214q3v\":\"Let members know they can tag Claude once it's live\",\"secret:r4ioj\":\"After launch, Claude will DM each member to help them get started. These messages don't count toward your usage.\",\"secret:1fai8oh\":\"Launch Claude Tag\",\"secret:19apu0s\":\"Channels and launch\",\"secret:ospnf3\":\"Let your team know\",\"secret:nr76hq\":\"Usage limits\",\"secret:7l22cm\":\"{step} (optional)\",\"secret:10jmx04\":\"The on-call's tool access applies to your whole workspace.\",\"secret:jdi55c\":\"The on-call keeps its existing workspace-wide tool access. Newly added channels get tool access in those channels only.\",\"secret:1ueuu9j\":\"Pick at least one channel or set a channel prefix.\",\"secret:1aybmd3\":\"Pick at least one channel.\",\"secret:1h6kck2\":\"Pick at least one channel.\",\"secret:19w181m\":\"On-call is live. Claude joins channels matching your prefix as they’re created.\",\"secret:le3ip5\":\"Source control\",\"secret:qjfh0e\":\"Review and deploy\",\"secret:11sc0j8\":\"Monitor my systems on an ongoing basis and help my team triage\",\"secret:145vsmt\":\"Claude watches your monitoring tools and posts what it finds in a channel you choose.\",\"secret:pp4tpb\":\"Claude joins new channels matching your naming pattern as they are created and starts investigating without being tagged.\",\"secret:9wmgyo\":\"Auto-join incident channels\",\"secret:1vbi8sr\":\"Next: {step}\",\"secret:1kby1f8\":\"Channel prefix\",\"secret:g34cvn\":\"#incident\",\"secret:oa3gmr\":\"{count, plural, one {# existing channel matches} other {# existing channels match}} {prefix} today.\",\"secret:1k8bfv1\":\"Enter a prefix, like #incident or #inc-.\",\"secret:6ahh1\":\"No existing channels match {prefix} yet.\",\"secret:i2ozyy\":\"A prefix can’t contain * or ?. Claude matches it exactly.\",\"secret:16s9v3r\":\"A prefix can only use lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens, periods, and underscores, up to 79 characters.\",\"secret:1cb6pmt\":\"Channels matching your prefix\",\"secret:89nl9t\":\"Which channels should Claude work in?\",\"secret:12im2s0\":\"Pick existing channels for Claude to work in, posting findings along the way. To add Claude to a channel, <code>/invite @Claude</code> in the channel.\",\"secret:svbkre\":\"Claude can't join this channel. Check the ID and workspace.\",\"secret:6xq9vy\":\"Channels matching your prefix are included automatically and can’t be unchecked.\",\"secret:toxocm\":\"Which channels Claude works in\",\"secret:d3sjm6\":\"Search channel name or by ID\",\"secret:1hhap84\":\"Channel not found\",\"secret:1y5i7k2\":\"Adding a private channel ID?\",\"secret:ud5gtk\":\"No matching channels.\",\"secret:1j7866b\":\"{count, plural, one {# more channel} other {# more channels}}\",\"secret:n1d55d\":\"{count, plural, one {# more channel} other {# more channels}}. Search to narrow the list.\",\"secret:e5wogs\":\"Claude isn’t in any Slack channels yet. Add it to a channel and it will show up here.\",\"secret:4ky2a9\":\"Workspace of the pasted channel\",\"secret:2los9f\":\"Show more\",\"secret:e3h1do\":\"Loading more channels…\",\"secret:1sx1v\":\"Couldn’t load more channels.\",\"secret:1oobzwa\":\"Only part of the channel directory loaded. Paste a channel ID to add a channel that isn’t listed.\",\"secret:17mozmz\":\"How Claude works an incident\",\"secret:1oz21b2\":\"Claude follows this prompt every time it joins an incident.\",\"secret:21565v\":\"What Claude keeps an eye on\",\"secret:tuesk6\":\"Tell Claude what to watch: services, metrics, and what counts as bad.\",\"secret:16ur7p5\":\"What Claude does\",\"secret:1gw1nn8\":\"Joins incident channels automatically\",\"secret:13bju4s\":\"Works in today’s matching incident channels\",\"secret:190p4oo\":\"Monitors systems and investigates on its own\",\"secret:a7x6ng\":\"e.g. Payments incidents\",\"secret:zfk65p\":\"Name (Access Bundle)\",\"secret:zjypkw\":\"An access bundle with this name already exists.\",\"secret:wg2eeu\":\"On-call\",\"secret:mxicwj\":\"Couldn’t create the on-call.\",\"secret:68fu4x\":\"Couldn’t rename the on-call.\",\"secret:z1yut0\":\"Connect your source control\",\"secret:h5u29h\":\"To investigate, Claude needs to see your code. Connect GitHub, or GitLab if that’s where your code lives, and pick the repos it can read.\",\"secret:ppa3l3\":\"Connect the tools Claude needs\",\"secret:1f8abmq\":\"To be useful, Claude needs to see your telemetry. Connect at least one tool.\",\"secret:1c3t31o\":\"Source control — connect one\",\"secret:1ja2rkz\":\"Only an organization admin can install the GitHub App. Ask one to connect it.\",\"secret:147ed22\":\"Claude Tag connects to a GitHub organization, not personal accounts. Install it on your organization instead.\",\"secret:jwantp\":\"GitHub\",\"secret:1d9jjpt\":\"Other monitoring service\",\"secret:1g8asud\":\"Using Claude Tag for more than on-call?\",\"secret:1yezs1w\":\"Connect anything else your team tags Claude about, like Drive, Salesforce or a custom MCP server.\",\"secret:1c3iut9\":\"Browse all tools\",\"secret:1nnirze\":\"Connect custom tool\",\"secret:1x0qn50\":\"Disconnect this tool?\",\"secret:1sqfggi\":\"Couldn’t disconnect. Try again.\",\"secret:17wy5gw\":\"Disconnect\",\"secret:1umwqda\":\"{product} was turned off for this organization. Turn it back on in its admin settings, then launch again.\",\"secret:1owr071\":\"{count, plural, one {# no-sign-in connector rule on this tool''s host will also be removed.} other {# no-sign-in connector rules on this tool''s host will also be removed.}}\",\"secret:1v152mn\":\"Connected\",\"secret:b1g1ty\":\"{count, plural, one {# repo selected} other {# repos selected}}\",\"secret:15cmo0m\":\"All repos\",\"secret:so2ghy\":\"Incident prompt\",\"secret:srg4m9\":\"Reset to default\",\"secret:1ss0c6a\":\"Written from the tools you connected.\",\"secret:e080iw\":\"Edited from the default.\",\"secret:smnr7i\":\"You are on the incident with us. When you join, read the channel first.\",\"secret:1n5s8ta\":\"Pull the current alerts, error rates and dashboards from {tools} for the affected service.\",\"secret:1vh23xf\":\"Pull whatever telemetry you can reach for the affected service.\",\"secret:1n5scz3\":\"Check {tools} for recent deploys, config changes and open PRs that touch it.\",\"secret:dysqk2\":\"Check what changed recently in the service.\",\"secret:vuo75k\":\"Post one short summary of what you see and what you suspect, and say what would confirm or rule it out. Keep updates in the thread.\",\"secret:12dn5c9\":\"Do not restart services, roll back, or change infrastructure — propose it and wait for a human.\",\"secret:8e266j\":\"Starting monitor prompt\",\"secret:erun0q\":\"e.g. Watch checkout latency and error rate in eu-west. Flag anything above 400ms p95 for five minutes.\",\"secret:kl685k\":\"Skills and plugins\",\"secret:1klu2if\":\"Channels starting with {prefix}: {count, plural, one {# matches today} other {# match today}}\",\"secret:17p1njb\":\"Channels starting with {prefix}\",\"secret:1kqt786\":\"No prefix set\",\"secret:17k2bth\":\"Plus {count, plural, one {# picked channel} other {# picked channels}}\",\"secret:tkg5rw\":\"Works in {channel}\",\"secret:z14tj6\":\"Works in {first} and {count, plural, one {# more channel} other {# more channels}}\",\"secret:1ybe1ju\":\"No monitoring channel picked\",\"secret:1it22i7\":\"Keeps its current workspace coverage.\",\"secret:bi2b4m\":\"None connected yet\",\"secret:7tbapo\":\"Repos\",\"secret:ymfigg\":\"None selected\",\"secret:yeog3y\":\"Default incident prompt\",\"secret:xncaik\":\"Edited incident prompt\",\"secret:96aq2\":\"Starting monitor prompt set\",\"secret:ofbegi\":\"Give this on-call a name.\",\"secret:ukpec6\":\"Connect GitHub or GitLab first.\",\"secret:16tggwo\":\"Select at least one repository.\",\"secret:ukpa6d\":\"Connect at least one tool.\",\"secret:ltls1b\":\"Continue without GitHub?\",\"secret:1xfnfu3\":\"Connecting GitHub lets Claude proactively root-cause incidents in your code and, when appropriate, prepare a fix. You can connect it later in {product} settings.\",\"secret:1xfye8y\":\"Connect GitHub\",\"secret:1kmf4a8\":\"Continue without GitHub\",\"secret:13yitsx\":\"Continue without tools?\",\"secret:f10gop\":\"Connecting tools like Sentry, Datadog, or PagerDuty gives Claude the logs, alerts, and traces it needs to investigate incidents as they happen. You can add them later in {product} settings.\",\"secret:f1bf3k\":\"Add a tool\",\"secret:wbmy2m\":\"Continue without tools\",\"secret:5yo3fw\":\"Connect GitHub so Claude can proactively root-cause incidents in your code and, when appropriate, prepare a fix.\",\"secret:1aerl8n\":\"Continue without repositories?\",\"secret:125do0j\":\"Granting repository access lets Claude proactively root-cause incidents in your code and, when appropriate, prepare a fix. You can add repositories later in {product} settings.\",\"secret:125omfe\":\"Select repositories\",\"secret:ajr4go\":\"Continue without repositories\",\"secret:w2ffbk\":\"Grant repository access so Claude can proactively root-cause incidents in your code and, when appropriate, prepare a fix.\",\"secret:4162kc\":\"Failed to add the marketplace. The credential wasn’t saved. Try again.\",\"secret:1hnw3pn\":\"Everything below turns on as soon as you deploy.\",\"secret:3ad2ud\":\"Deploy on-call\",\"secret:11diwj\":\"On-call is live.\",\"secret:19qno09\":\"On-call saved. Add channels to deploy it.\",\"secret:1xgwj2g\":\"Couldn’t add the on-call to some channels. Try deploying again.\",\"secret:7tv6xb\":\"Couldn’t remove the on-call from some channels. Try deploying again.\",\"secret:1sia8t2\":\"Couldn’t save the auto-join channel pattern. Try deploying again.\",\"secret:g2y4k9\":\"The workspace’s auto-join pattern list is full, so this prefix wasn’t added. Manage patterns in the workspace’s advanced settings.\",\"secret:y9mvg0\":\"This org’s Slack pairing is channel-only, so auto-join can’t be turned on. Today’s matching channels are still included.\",\"secret:15ucsgx\":\"This org’s Slack pairing is channel-only, so auto-join can’t be turned on. Deploying will still include today’s matching channels.\",\"secret:1rmhb3o\":\"An admin’s channel-name deny rule covers this prefix, so auto-join won’t add matching channels. You can change the deny rules in the workspace’s advanced settings.\",\"secret:pxbfj2\":\"eng-alerts\",\"secret:1hffd6b\":\"Claude is watching\",\"secret:1ocde02\":\"Checks run in the background and land here.\",\"secret:1wbjegg\":\"Pick a channel and checks land there.\",\"secret:1fcbg5g\":\"Ready to turn on for your monitoring channel.\",\"secret:qlhoix\":\"Ready to turn on for your incident channels.\",\"secret:lg59ns\":\"Ready to turn on for {prefix}.\",\"secret:2i2087\":\"Deploy\",\"secret:10v1o2r\":\"View setup\",\"secret:1484rpb\":\"Claude is writing…\",\"secret:l1e4p7\":\"Creating document…\",\"secret:1960hah\":\"First year bonus: Get {amount} in usage credits\",\"secret:tlgapz\":\"For eligible customers who commit to {share}/mo.\",\"secret:1tc37r4\":\"Terms apply\",\"secret:1px3fy4\":\"Get {amount} in credits to help cover your usage\",\"secret:xss41g\":\"Divided equally over your first 12 months when you commit {share}/mo. For eligible customers.\",\"secret:1afq4d8\":\"You’re eligible for {amount} in usage credits.\",\"secret:1c4x6qu\":\"New organizations aren’t eligible for a first year bonus\",\"secret:1tw89qi\":\"Upgrade your organization to get {amount} in usage credits.\",\"secret:1bvxsd4\":\"First year bonus: {amount} in usage credits every month\",\"secret:j5w5nc\":\"Added to your account automatically through {date}. Each month’s credits expire 45 days after they’re added.\",\"secret:18s4olh\":\"Decline offer\",\"secret:7he2eq\":\"First year bonus declined\",\"secret:11fafq5\":\"Restore offer\",\"secret:1vkclg\":\"+{amount} in usage credits\",\"secret:1uugoaz\":\"Monthly usage\",\"secret:foljn6\":\"Auto-billed for your first 12 months\",\"secret:1hb3g9f\":\"First year bonus\",\"secret:1qu7l3t\":\"Ended\",\"secret:1nrapb9\":\"Buy {share} in usage credits each month, get {credit} for free. Through {date}.\",\"secret:1clr5gk\":\"Turned off on {date}. Usage credits already added to your balance aren’t affected.\",\"secret:99xv3e\":\"Ended on {date}. Usage credits already added to your balance aren’t affected.\",\"secret:1wtw2qc\":\"Turn off first year bonus?\",\"secret:bdkdd2\":\"Your organization will stop getting {credit} in free usage credits each month and will no longer be charged {share} each month. Usage credits already in your balance aren’t affected.\",\"secret:1q5nwya\":\"First year bonus is turned off.\",\"secret:kbeyra\":\"First year bonus had already ended.\",\"secret:1v3ilbf\":\"First year bonus couldn’t be turned off. You can try again.\",\"secret:6ao8rw\":\"Turn on first year bonus?\",\"secret:135a7f2\":\"Your organization will be charged {share} each month and receive {credit} in free usage credits each month, through {date}.\",\"secret:4ao4m4\":\"First year bonus is turned on.\",\"secret:ikf7hf\":\"First year bonus was already on.\",\"secret:63v8nd\":\"First year bonus can’t be turned back on.\",\"secret:ogi3nn\":\"First year bonus couldn’t be turned on. You can try again.\",\"secret:1x0v4hy\":\"To switch to bank transfer, turn off your first year bonus from your billing settings. The bonus is only available by card payment.\",\"secret:sg9fm6\":\"Auto-billed monthly usage\",\"secret:dou7np\":\"Auto-billed monthly usage - {date}\",\"secret:uaesml\":\"{percent}% used · Expires {date}\",\"secret:147hvrz\":\"{percent}% used\",\"secret:uagsdd\":\"+{amount} usage credits\",\"secret:9fvpl4\":\"Courses, tutorials, and use cases from Claude Academy.\",\"secret:nb5ljp\":\"Featured courses\",\"secret:1ifaagt\":\"Self-paced, multi-lesson courses on Claude Academy.\",\"secret:5pkf59\":\"Getting started\",\"secret:mjs89h\":\"Short tutorials on the basics, a few minutes each.\",\"secret:17st0p4\":\"Browse by role\",\"secret:1rm04hc\":\"Prompts, use cases, and tutorials for the kind of work you do.\",\"secret:f6f2dv\":\"For you: {role}\",\"secret:871f8w\":\"See all for {role}\",\"secret:se16o9\":\"Other roles\",\"secret:1dwzli2\":\"Try a prompt\",\"secret:1m7zk76\":\"Each prompt opens as a draft you can edit before sending.\",\"secret:15sada\":\"Walk through a real workflow step by step.\",\"secret:s9drk8\":\"Learn new products and features.\",\"secret:1wl3w9z\":\"See all on Claude Academy\",\"secret:x1w788\":\"Course\",\"secret:m1m9az\":\"Tutorial\",\"secret:e5pe79\":\"Use case\",\"secret:1uq7t8v\":\"{count, plural, one {# lesson} other {# lessons}}\",\"secret:c6yxkj\":\"{minutes} min\",\"secret:1rrx6ym\":\"Opens Claude Academy in a new tab\",\"secret:12af54o\":\"Schedule a learning check-in\",\"secret:11vy62q\":\"Choose what to practice and how often. Claude sets up a scheduled task in Cowork.\",\"secret:15e2wgm\":\"Set up\",\"secret:11z20nj\":\"Learning check-in\",\"secret:1cpx1c4\":\"I'd like to set up a recurring learning check-in. Ask me what I want to get better at using Claude and how often I'd like to check in (for example, weekly or every two weeks). Then suggest a day and time, and wait for me to confirm before creating anything. Once I confirm, create one scheduled task on that cadence. Each time it runs, ask what I've tried since last time, help me practice one new thing, and suggest what to try next. Set up only this one task. Don't create, change, or schedule anything else.\"},\"gates\":[\"claudified_admin_footprint_notice\",\"epitaxy_ccr_teleport_upsell_main\",\"epitaxy_ccr_teleport_upsell_creative\",\"claudified_velvet_kestrel\",\"claudeai_trivet_main\",\"bendep-verifications-management\",\"claudeai_spearmint_main\",\"proj-chalk-canva-teacher-oauth\",\"proj-chalk-enterprise\",\"proj-chalk-settings\",\"cowork_remote_device_election\",\"prism_vault_echo\",\"ss_enterprise_invoice_total_cap\",\"operon_access\",\"ccr_velvet_broom\",\"ccr_autofix_ui\",\"ccr_routine_notify_slack\",\"amber_tributary_lantern_main\",\"ccr_shr_environment_status_banner\",\"trusted_device_self_attestation\",\"bridge_trusted_devices\",\"cowork_trusted_devices_self_serve_toggle\",\"step_up_reauth_enabled\",\"ccr_once_over\",\"cowork_auto_permission_mode\",\"cowork_lantern_cloud\",\"cowork_lantern_dune\",\"cowork_bypass_permissions_mode\",\"cache_scoped_prompt_ordering\",\"max_20x_extension_coupon\",\"claudeai_saffron