              "value": "__oailb=eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6Im9haWxiLXYxIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJob3N0IjoiY2hhdC5nYXRld2F5LnVuaWZpZWQtMzkuYXBpLm9wZW5haS5jb20iLCJpc3MiOiJlZGdlLWdhdGV3YXkiLCJhdWQiOlsiY2hhdGdwdC5jb20iXSwiZXhwIjoxNzg4MzU4ODMwLCJpYXQiOjE3ODgzNTQ5MzB9.YyCWkB0hnLIDaf3C-3lnKZb5xygPpZpBSuFoBR8J3i0KZ5MPESIinNQDw3lw9LP2HKasXO1tyIcdgnFz4Wth8w; Path=/; Expires=Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:15:30 GMT; Max-Age=3600; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax, __cf_bm=hcY1__G1AU7SyQRtKKMqARQbnEK3tURbioJWa0AcEzo-1788354930.8193023-1.0.1.1-JS4h0JeikzQzfHzL9zbGQcTZXA.BUYbxegqCUtCcMkRJbf7lP1xppJmt._JLXX_aX.VCxK9vHS3eQReaGs25md55wr7O4A1k.E9MV3KQdHDqSZmomAhU0oOTmd68SnO3; HttpOnly; SameSite=None; Secure; Path=/; Domain=chatgpt.com; Expires=Wed, 02 Sep 2026 13:45:31 GMT, __cflb=0H28vzvP5FJafnkHxj4Wsg6rMEnmw8zYf2c6hYb7c6X; HttpOnly; SameSite=None; Secure; Path=/; Expires=Wed, 02 Sep 2026 14:15:31 GMT"
